    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fast-paced block puzzle game where strategy, speed, and skill collide. The rules are simple: stack blocks, clear lines, and survive. The challenge goes beyond reflexes \u2014 master the <strong>fluxing mechanics</strong>\u00a0to dominate the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Blocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily customize block skins by adding your own images to the game\u2019s mod folder. No complex setup\u2014just drop your files and play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Campaign:</strong> A roguelite RPG adventure where every cleared stage uncovers new challenges, abilities, and hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi-Score Mode:</strong> Global leaderboard scoring for 1 or 2 players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Clear lines and match gems to attack the opponent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manglish Mode: </strong>Experience Malaysian-style English in this special mode! Perfect for locals and a fun way for everyone else to dive into authentic Malaysian slang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks that shift and transform, creating a dynamic twist on classic puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique power-ups and game-changing abilities to turn the tide in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets, cryptic developer notes, and a deep world waiting to be uncovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cerebral block-stacking unlike anything you've experienced before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your strategy, push your skills to the limit, and embrace the challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ominoflux</i> is waiting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fast-paced block puzzle game where strategy, speed, and skill collide. The rules are simple: stack blocks, clear lines, and survive. The challenge goes beyond reflexes \u2014 master the <strong>fluxing mechanics</strong>\u00a0to dominate the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Blocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily customize block skins by adding your own images to the game\u2019s mod folder. No complex setup\u2014just drop your files and play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Campaign:</strong> A roguelite RPG adventure where every cleared stage uncovers new challenges, abilities, and hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi-Score Mode:</strong> Global leaderboard scoring for 1 or 2 players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Clear lines and match gems to attack the opponent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manglish Mode: </strong>Experience Malaysian-style English in this special mode! Perfect for locals and a fun way for everyone else to dive into authentic Malaysian slang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/c8ac5ed4f893f352d0b5d1fe92b71b6d.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/7224002359684d0b668de697c8b08fa6.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/af81dcd6482bc4c56612438dc94e8d90.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.poster.avif?t=1748701699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.webm?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/646fef351c8a1ca4021f3800d0e329d4.mp4?t=1748701699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks that shift and transform, creating a dynamic twist on classic puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique power-ups and game-changing abilities to turn the tide in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets, cryptic developer notes, and a deep world waiting to be uncovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cerebral block-stacking unlike anything you've experienced before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your strategy, push your skills to the limit, and embrace the challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ominoflux</i> is waiting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
